OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine to end Saturday, with
OL,7,Fskies remaining clear at first
OL,8,Ftonight, and turning chilly. Cloud
OL,9,Fincreasing through the night,
OL,10,Fparticularly in the west, with a risk
OL,11,Fof rain here towards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA largely dry but cloudy start
OL,14,Fon Sunday. Heavy and persistent rain
OL,15,Fwill arrive from the west through the
OL,16,Fmorning, with strengthening winds.
OL,17,FMild but feeling cooler in the rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
